          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodete kitojoka ikiyakia ka imakio ka ekanisa kere, aseun ituŋa lukotomakec, aiyakiar Antiokia nepepe ka Paul ka Baranaba; kes luta, Yuda loenyaritai Barasaba, ka Sila, lukeraas ikeŋarenikinok koinacan: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiwadikata kwanata kijukasi kakaninikec ebe: “Iinacan ikiyakia ka imakio mama ejaas iinacan lueraas Imo kotoma Antiokia ka Suria ka Kilikia, ayogan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
