              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ketuboros apaarasia adis, kotema Paul Baranaba atiar, “Aso kabonosi kwana kaanyanasi iinacan kaŋolire nekiilimonokinit akirot naka Ejakait, kaanyutu kwape ejaatar.” ",
          "type": "text",
