              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konye mam kitojokit Paul ayaŋaar ŋol lokinyeini kes koPampulia, komam elosete kakes aswam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
